}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="map"></div>
<div class="header">
 <div class="brand card">
  <h1>Limerick + Old Louisville Property Conditions Explorer</h1>
  <p>Property conditions and open PM work orders within the official Limerick and Old Louisville neighborhood boundaries. <b>ADDRESS POPUPS ON</b></p>
 </div>
 <div class="controls">
  <button class="btn" id="bothBtn">Both</button><button class="btn" id="limBtn">Limerick</button><button class="btn" id="olBtn">Old Louisville</button>
 </div>
</div>

<div class="searchbox">
 <input id="search" placeholder="Search address…" autocomplete="off">
 <button class="btn" id="searchBtn">Search</button>
</div>
<div class="results" id="results"></div>

<div class="panel card">
 <h2>Map Layers</h2>
 <div class="layer"><input id="workToggle" type="checkbox" checked><span class="swatch circle"></span><label for="workToggle">Open PM Work Orders</label><span class="count" id="workCount"></span></div>
 <div class="layer"><input id="occupiedToggle" type="checkbox" checked><span class="swatch occ" style="background:#3f9a69"></span><label for="occupiedToggle">Occupied</label><span class="count" id="occupiedCount"></span></div>
 <div class="layer"><input id="unoccupiedToggle" type="checkbox" checked><span class="swatch occ" style="background:#9c5bd6"></span><label for="unoccupiedToggle">Unoccupied / Vacant / Other</label><span class="count" id="unoccupiedCount"></span></div>
 <div class="layer"><input id="boundsToggle" type="checkbox" checked><span class="swatch outline"></span><label for="boundsToggle">Neighborhood Boundaries</label><span class="count">2</span></div>
 <p class="note" id="neighborhoodSummary"></p>
 <p class="note">Address search searches mapped addresses first, then uses OpenStreetMap geocoding for any other street address inside the two-neighborhood map area. Internet access is required for the background map and external address lookup.</p>
</div>


